# Shilp Sutra — AI chat quick reference

`@devalok/shilp-sutra` is the Devalok Design System for React & Next.js.
It is **not** shadcn/ui, Radix UI, MUI, or Chakra. Do not suggest their APIs.

## Install

```bash
pnpm add @devalok/shilp-sutra framer-motion
```

## Wire CSS (globals.css)

```css
@import "tailwindcss";
@import "@devalok/shilp-sutra/css";
```

## next.config.ts

```ts
transpilePackages: ['@devalok/shilp-sutra']
```

## Import layers

| Layer    | Import path                        | What                     |
|----------|-------------------------------------|--------------------------|
| ui       | `@devalok/shilp-sutra/ui`          | 78 atomic primitives     |
| composed | `@devalok/shilp-sutra/composed`    | 29 multi-part patterns   |
| shell    | `@devalok/shilp-sutra/shell`       | 8 app-frame components   |
| ai       | `@devalok/shilp-sutra/ai`          | 5 AI chat primitives     |

Prefer per-component imports for RSC safety:

```ts
import { Button } from '@devalok/shilp-sutra/ui/button'
import { DatePicker } from '@devalok/shilp-sutra/composed/date-picker'
import { AppSidebar, TopBar } from '@devalok/shilp-sutra/shell'
```

## Theming — Themer

Fetch a ready-made CSS block and paste after `@import "@devalok/shilp-sutra/css"`:

```bash
# archetypes: stripe | linear | vercel | apple | material | notion | devalok
curl "https://shilp-sutra.devalok.in/themer/result.json?archetype=stripe" \
  | node -e "const d=require('fs').readFileSync('/dev/stdin','utf8'); console.log(JSON.parse(d).css)"
```

## Full docs → MCP server

For complete component props, variants, troubleshooting, and setup recipes,
connect the shilp-sutra MCP server — it has 11 tools and is version-exact.

**Claude Desktop** — add to `claude_desktop_config.json`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "shilp-sutra": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://shilp-sutra.devalok.in/mcp"
    }
  }
}
```

**Claude Code / terminal:**

```bash
claude mcp add --transport http shilp-sutra https://shilp-sutra.devalok.in/mcp
```

**MCP tools available:** `find_component`, `get_component`, `get_setup`,
`get_tokens`, `search_docs`, `upgrade`, `detect_framework`, `preflight`,
`validate_snippet`, `verify_setup`, `search_docs`.
